# Trace query — real Donghu frame, multi-layer causes
#
# Coverage target: with a large customer-scale trace attached by file path, the
# system should derive repeated on-chain wakeup dependencies itself, rank
# cumulative on-chain runnable and D/io_wait causes as primary layers, and keep
# source-status wording out of a trace-only answer.
ID="trace_query_donghu_real_frame_multicausal"
NAME="trace query — real Donghu frame multi-layer causes"
QUESTION="只分析这份 trace，不分析代码。请分析 com.baidu.tieba 59566 主线程在 34579.472865s 到 34579.587805s 这一帧窗口内的卡顿原因。请分层说明直接阻塞/唤醒关系、链上主要原因、调度/资源背景，以及代表性时间窗。"
HTRACE_FILE="../../customlogs/xxx_all.systrace"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="CookieMonsterCl NetworkService ThreadPoolForeg"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(唤醒链|依赖链|wakeup chain|chain).*(ThreadPoolForeg|NetworkService|CookieMonsterCl|com\\.baidu\\.tieba)
(runnable|可运行|调度|scheduler|CPU|runqueue).*(CookieMonsterCl|NetworkService|优先级反转|priority inversion)|(CookieMonsterCl|NetworkService|优先级反转|priority inversion).*(runnable|可运行|调度|scheduler|CPU|runqueue)
(D-state|D 状态|Uninterruptible|io_wait|iowait|不可中断|IO).*(ThreadPoolForeg|fscache|block|page cache)|(ThreadPoolForeg|fscache|block|page cache).*(D-state|D 状态|Uninterruptible|io_wait|iowait|不可中断|IO)
34579\\.525
34579\\.546
34579\\.576
(主因|主要原因|primary|co-primary|并列|共同|多层)"
